重点是那个枕套 我小时候就开始用了
It's the pillowcase. I've had it since I was a kid.

179
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:46,200
它又软又有触感
It's like soft and nubby

180
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:48,500
还有边边 我可以摸
and it had this edge that I'd like...rub,

181
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:50,380
在倒霉的日子 也就是每一天
and it relaxed me when things were crappy,

182
00:07:50,380 --> 00:07:51,740
都能让我放松
which was all the time.

183
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:54,640
我需要那个枕套才能睡着
I guess I still need that pillowcase to sleep or whatever.

184
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,100
麦克斯 你好可怜哦
Max, that's so sad.

185
00:07:57,100 --> 00:07:58,320
当然可怜啊
Of course it's sad!

186
00:07:58,380 --> 00:08:00,020
我有过欢乐童话故事吗
When has it ever been a happy tale?

187
00:08:01,140 --> 00:08:02,760
好啦 我得爬进去
All right, I need to crawl in here.

188
00:08:03,340 --> 00:08:05,800
麦克斯 你要爬进这脏箱子啊
Max, you're just gonna crawl into that dirty box?

189
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,540
我们都不知道这箱子有多脏
We don't know where that bin's been.

190
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:09,140
对了
By the way,

191
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:11,700
"脏箱子"[脏货]也是我当年在学校的绰号
"dirty box" was my nickname in continuation school.

192
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,640
帮忙一下
I need help.

193
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:15,360
你是要我踩你背上 还是踩你的头
Would you rather I step on your back or your head?

194
00:08:15,700 --> 00:08:18,380
想都别想 这么贵的头会给你踩吗
My head? Hardly. Not at these prices.

195
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:20,600
来吧 十根手指伸出来
Come on, gimme ten fingers.

196
00:08:20,740 --> 00:08:21,240
给过了
I already did.

197
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,740
来的路上伸过十次中指
Behind your back while we were walking here.

198
00:08:23,020 --> 00:08:24,980
是让你这样 我就能踩着上去
No, like this, so I can step into it.

199
00:08:24,980 --> 00:08:26,200
就跟个手指篮子一样
You know, like a finger basket.

200
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:27,420
手指篮[装蛋蛋]
Finger basket?

201
00:08:27,500 --> 00:08:28,920
那是你的另一个绰号吗
Is that another nickname of yours?

202
00:08:30,700 --> 00:08:32,620
不是 但某年夏天本来可以的
No, but for one summer, it could've been.

203
00:08:33,540 --> 00:08:35,800
那算了 来帮忙搬东西让我踩吧
Forget this, just let me pull this stuff over.

204
00:08:39,800 --> 00:08:41,660
麦克斯 我觉得我们一直在突破下限
Max, I feel like we're not even acknowledging

205
00:08:41,660 --> 00:08:42,800
下限都成路人了
our low points anymore.

206
00:08:43,380 --> 00:08:45,500
麦克斯 千万小心
Okay, Max, now be very careful.

207
00:08:45,580 --> 00:08:47,200
等我数到...
And on the count of...

208
00:08:49,220 --> 00:08:51,240
你完全能当体操员啊
Wow! You could've been a great gymnast,

209
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:53,380
如果你有钱 有教练 做了缩胸手术的话
if you'd had money, coaches, and a breast reduction.

210
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:55,540
你没事吧
Are you okay?

211
00:08:57,100 --> 00:08:57,660
麦克斯
Max?

212
00:08:58,340 --> 00:08:59,620
发点声音出来啊
Gonna need some voice contact.

213
00:09:00,580 --> 00:09:02,180
吾路不孤
I'm not in here alone.

214
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:09,320
你说吾路不孤是个什么意思
What do you mean you're not alone?

215
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:12,140
意思是 里面不只我一个人
I mean, I'm not in here alone.

216
00:09:13,140 --> 00:09:15,760
别慌 我马上救你出来
Stay calm! I will get you out of there.

217
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:16,940
不 我做不到
No, I won't.

218
00:09:18,780 --> 00:09:21,060
我在找打开门的把手
I'm looking for a lever on the inside.

219
00:09:23,660 --> 00:09:25,260
滚出我家
Get outta my house!

220
00:09:26,980 --> 00:09:29,760
我只是想看看你是不是压在我的枕套上
I just wanna check and see if you're on my pillowcase.

221
00:09:29,820 --> 00:09:31,700
-别啊 麦克斯 -我要我亲爱的寝具
- Max, no! - I need my sweet sheets!

222
00:09:32,500 --> 00:09:33,280
放弃吧
Let it go.

223
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:35,640
如果被他压在身下了 那也不亲不爱了
If your sheets are under there, they're no long sweet.

224
00:09:36,020 --> 00:09:37,420
滚出我家
Get outta my house!

225
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:38,580
关上门
Close the door!

226
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,380
行行行
Okay! Okay!

227
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:43,320
真是的 咱俩也算睡过了 真无情
God, sheez. You'd think we'd slept together.

228
00:09:44,660 --> 00:09:45,880
这下我得怎么办
What am I gonna do?

229
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,540
没那套寝具我就睡不着
I can't sleep without those sheets.

230
00:09:47,660 --> 00:09:48,840
我恨死你了
I'm so angry at you!

231
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:51,880
要不是发现这件好奶罩 我会更气
I'd be even angrier if I hadn't found this great bra.

232
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:58,880
你想睡觉为啥还要来苏菲家
Why are you going to Sophie's if you're trying to sleep?

233
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,820
她是我们认识最大嗓门的人了
She's the loudest person we know.

234
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:03,700
电影院里爱喧哗的黑人都嫌她吵
Even black people at the movies tell Sophie to be quiet.

235
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:08,420
我来她家是想要个安眠药
I am going to Sophie's to get a sleeping pill.

236
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:10,260
也就是她口中的"晚安糖"
Or as she likes to call them, "night candy".

237
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:12,380
你不需要吃安眠药
You don't need a pill.

238
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,520
我有一招很棒的入眠方法
Listen, I have a great sleep technique

239
00:10:14,520 --> 00:10:15,680
是我的睡眠教练教我的
that my sleep coach taught me.

240
00:10:15,700 --> 00:10:17,580
我也跟一堆教练"睡"过
I have slept with my fair share of coaches,

241
00:10:17,580 --> 00:10:18,920
他们的唯一用处就是让我不能睡
and if anything, they kept me awake.

242
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,200
麦克斯 凌晨三点
Max, it's 3:00 A.M.

243
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:23,280
正常人应该都睡了
Any normal person is sleeping right now.

244
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,760
姑娘们
Hi, girls.

245
00:10:27,640 --> 00:10:30,217
我一边听猫王 一边拼拼图呢
Just doing a puzzle and listening to Elvis.

246
00:10:30,217 --> 00:10:34,655
趁你们还没累累 先来杯酒酒吧
You two want a mai tai before you get too ty-ty?

247
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:37,500
不用了 但说到累累
No, thanks, but speaking of ty-ty,

248
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:40,060
我想问你要一颗安眠药
I was hoping I could snag one of your sleeping pills.

249
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:42,340
没问题 我能给你
Oh, sure, I can hook you up.

250
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,680
我从来不用
I never use them.

251
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:45,940
我晚上都只需要睡三小时
I only need three hours of sleep at night

252
00:10:45,940 --> 00:10:48,060
白天再睡个六小时 进来吧
and six during the day. Come on.

253
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:51,360
苏菲
Sophie...

254
00:10:52,140 --> 00:10:53,700
发现哪里是新的吗
Notice anything new?

255
00:10:54,380 --> 00:10:55,460
有啊
Oh! Yeah!

256
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,620
你头上接了更多头发吗
You planted more hair on your head.

257
00:10:57,940 --> 00:10:58,300
我听说了
I heard.

258
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:03,080
麦克斯 你居然告诉她
Max! You told her?

259
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,540
没 这事都上新闻联播了
No, it was on CNN.

260
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,200
先报导了叙利亚的新闻
They led with Syria,

261
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:08,120
然后连续报道了五分钟你头发的事
and then did a solid five on your hair.

262
00:11:08,860 --> 00:11:11,100
来啦 药跟香料
Here we go-- pills and spices!

263
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:13,457
你有满香料架的药吗
You have a spice rack full of pills?

264
00:11:13,457 --> 00:11:16,312
改天下厨做顿晚餐请我吃吧
You gotta cook me dinner sometime.

265
00:11:17,180 --> 00:11:18,360
我看看
Let's see.

266
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:22,000
鱼油 盘尼西林 阿莫西林
Fish oil, penicillin, amoxicillin...

267
00:11:22,900 --> 00:11:23,560
彩虹糖
Skittles.

268
00:11:25,780 --> 00:11:28,280
这是我的德国神药
Oh, and this is my German pill

269
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:31,780
哪天核弹大爆发 还是我被放逐外星时吃
in case they release the bombs or I'm ever abandoned in space.

270
00:11:33,598 --> 00:11:37,300
给 麦克斯 睡个好觉
Here you go, Max. Nighty-night.

271
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:38,480
这样吧
Oh, you know what?

272
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:41,160
管这么多干嘛 老娘也来一粒
What the hell! I'm gonna have one too.

273
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,540
这是睡衣派对
It's a slumber party!

274
00:11:46,260 --> 00:11:48,760
你又有另一架子[胸部]的药了
Oh, now you got another rack full of pills.

275
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:52,580
算了吧
Oh, you know what?

276
00:11:53,900 --> 00:11:56,860
别等我了 麦克斯 估计得找一会
Don't wait for me, Max. This might be a while.

277
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:01,800
麦克斯 你真的得靠药物吗
Max, do you really need to take that?

278
00:12:01,900 --> 00:12:03,960
吃完安眠药 很多人会做怪事
People do weird things on sleeping pills.

279
00:12:04,260 --> 00:12:05,740
我一个朋友
My friend Candice Travelstead

280
00:12:05,740 --> 00:12:07,900
梦游用奶油涂满皮夹 还打算吃下去
buttered a wallet and tried to eat it.

281
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:10,560
别担心 我没皮夹
Don't worry, I don't have a wallet.

282
00:12:10,740 --> 00:12:12,680
等等 等等
Wait a minute! Wait a minute.

283
00:12:12,680 --> 00:12:14,080
你那颗是安眠药
Is that the sleeping pill,

284
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:17,280
还是我的紧急自杀太空药
or is that my emergency space pill that kills you?

285
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,360
两种都能让我闭眼安眠
Either way, I'll get some shut-eye.

286
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:21,160
麦克斯 不许
Max, no!

287
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:23,060
不许你抛下我一人在这世界上
You are not gonna die and leave me here alone.

288
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:24,860
在没有监护人带领的情况下 我还没搞懂
I still don't know how to go east on the "L" Train

289
00:12:24,860 --> 00:12:25,800
怎么坐L火号车去东边
without a chaperone.

290
00:12:28,020 --> 00:12:29,780
麦克斯 现在是凌晨3点30分
Max, it's 3:30 A.M.,

291
00:12:29,780 --> 00:12:31,600
睡眠教练卡洛琳
and sleep coach Caroline here

292
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:34,020
最晚能让你在3点45分安然入睡哦
will have you asleep by 3:45 the latest.

293
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:37,180
你不是应该泡个热水澡吗
You're supposed to be taking a hot bath.

294
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:39,040
本来是 但当我把塞子塞进去时
I was, but when I put the stopper in,

295
00:12:39,040 --> 00:12:40,340
有东西又把它给顶出来了
something pushed it back out again.

296
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:41,980
药片在哪里
Where's that pill?

297
00:12:41,980 --> 00:12:43,520
我藏在身上呢
I've got it on my person,

298
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:45,580
如果这些都不管用 我就把它给你
and if this doesn't work I'll give it to you.

299
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:47,380
为了药片 整只手伸入你洞内找
Oh, I'll go elbow-deep for that pill.

300
00:12:47,380 --> 00:12:48,360
我都会做哦
And don't think I won't.

301
00:12:49,260 --> 00:12:51,300
麦克斯 这是你的新寝具
Max, meet your new sheets.

302
00:12:51,520 --> 00:12:52,540
新寝具 这是...
New sheets, meet--

303
00:12:52,620 --> 00:12:54,860
用不着互相介绍 我又不是神经病人
Don't make me meet the sheets. I'm not a mental patient.

304
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:58,060
如果我是 那住的地方会比这好多了
If I was, I'd be living in a much nicer place.

305
00:12:58,060 --> 00:13:00,140
而且我所有的枕套都会有花边
And all my pillowcases would have edges.

306
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:02,660
哇 你的枕套居然有花边啊
Wow, even your pillowcase had an edge.

307
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,240
你的枕套到底是什么样的
What was it like anyway?

308
00:13:04,620 --> 00:13:06,640
就像是你新睡衣下面那样
It was kinda like the end of your new PJs,

309
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:08,420
但你的睡衣是我见过最基的东西
but not the queerest thing I've ever seen.

310
00:13:09,900 --> 00:13:12,400
还点蜡烛 你以为我们是女巫吗
A candle? What are we, witches?

311
00:13:13,660 --> 00:13:17,720
现在想象自己处在一个轻松美丽的地方
Now, imagine yourself in a relaxed, beautiful place.

312
00:13:18,540 --> 00:13:20,420
让呼吸自由进出
Breathe in and out.

313
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:23,440
吸气 呼气
In and out.

314
00:13:23,620 --> 00:13:26,600
听着 手指篮姑娘唯一了解的事情
Look, if there's one thing old finger basket know how to do

315
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:27,320
那就是"进跟出"
it's in and out.

316
00:13:27,925 --> 00:13:29,580
把药片给我
Gimme the pill.

317
00:13:29,580 --> 00:13:30,660
我还没说完呢
I'm not finished yet.

318
00:13:30,660 --> 00:13:31,620
但先提醒你
But just so you know,

319
00:13:31,620 --> 00:13:34,420
那颗药片在一个小时里变色了三次了
that pill has changed colors three times in the last hour.

320
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:37,260
要么会吃死人 要么就是五彩糖球
So it's either deadly, or an Everlasting Gobstopper.

321
00:13:37,900 --> 00:13:40,720
我真是被你气死了 你就拿走我唯一一样
I am so mad at you. You took my one thing.

322
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:42,760
我生命中有特别意义的东西
That pillowcase was my one special thing.

323
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:45,020
我的人生中 人们从我身边拿走了很多东西
In my whole life of people taking things away from me,

324
00:13:45,020 --> 00:13:46,620
唯有那个枕套从来没人会拿
that was the one thing no one took,

325
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:48,240
而现在我再也睡不着了
and now I'm never gonna sleep again.

326
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,220
我爱睡觉
And I love sleeping.

327
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:51,880
做梦是我离有线电视最接近的时刻了
Dreaming is the closest thing I have to cable TV.

328
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:54,380
够了 麦克斯
Enough, Max!

329
00:13:54,400 --> 00:13:57,520
在你对"一张床单"[屎]过分依赖的事情上
I've been very patient with this weird attachment you have

330
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:59,140
我已经够耐心了
to this little piece of sheet.

331
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:00,960
你才是"一坨屎"呢
You're a piece of sheet.

332
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:06,020
在我失去一切时 我懂得两个道理
Listen, if I learned anything when I lost everything,

333
00:14:06,020 --> 00:14:07,780
那就是 第一
It's that, "A," there's no wiggle room

334
00:14:07,780 --> 00:14:09,660
白干酪的保质期限说到就到了
when it comes to cottage cheese expiration dates,

335
00:14:09,760 --> 00:14:13,020
第二 你不能过于依赖物质事物
And "B," You can't get attached to material things.

336
00:14:14,060 --> 00:14:15,400
得了吧 接发不算吗
Okay, extensions.

337
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,120
这话什么意思
What does that mean?

338
00:14:17,560 --> 00:14:19,280
意思就是准确来说
It means that your material things

339
00:14:19,280 --> 00:14:21,200
你依赖的事物粘了你满脑袋
are literally attached to your head.

340
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:22,660
完全不一样好吗
Not the same thing at all.

341
00:14:22,660 --> 00:14:24,880
你满脑子都是你对那个枕套的依赖
Your dependency on that pillowcase is all in your head,

342
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:25,620
而你却不需要它
you don't need it.

343
00:14:25,940 --> 00:14:26,880
那你也不需要这个
Oh. You don't need this.

344
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:31,320
你欠我14块
You owe me $14.

345
00:14:32,780 --> 00:14:33,600
先记账吧
Run a tab.

346
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:36,480
我才不要坐在这里忍受你的侮辱
I'm not about to sit here and take this abuse

347
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:38,900
就因为你对一个枕套有着病态的依赖心理
because you have an unhealthy attachment to a pillowcase.

348
00:14:39,180 --> 00:14:40,240
晚安 马里布芭比
Good night, Malibu Barbie.

349
00:14:41,020 --> 00:14:42,540
希望你不是想要侮辱我
I hope you're not trying to insult me,

350
00:14:42,540 --> 00:14:43,800
因为你这话是在赞美我
because she's gorgeous!

351
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,400
对了 郑重声明
And for the record,

352
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:47,520
我对我的头发才没有什么病态的依赖心理
I do not have an unhealthy attachment to my hair.

353
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:48,160
是吗
Oh, really.

354
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:52,360
你个禽兽
You're a monster!

355
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:58,020
对不起 人家睡不着嘛
I'm sorry, I can't sleep.

356
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:59,980
只要你把药片给我 我就没事了
I'll be fine. Just give me the pill.

357
00:15:00,180 --> 00:15:01,420
只是你心理作用
No! It's all in your head!

358
00:15:01,420 --> 00:15:02,120
快去睡觉
Go to sleep!

359
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:05,580
我用绳子把门把和我的床绑到一起
I tied the doorknob to my bed with a rope

360
00:15:05,580 --> 00:15:07,140
然后把卧室所有的窗户都关上了
and locked all the bedroom windows.

361
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:09,680
你是想伤害我 还是想让我欲火焚身啊
Are you trying to hurt me or turn me on?

362
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:18,120
你要做好心理准备 厄尔
Brace yourself, Earl.

363
00:15:18,260 --> 00:15:20,500
麦克斯今天上班的心情不会太好哦
When Max gets here, she will not be in a good mood.

364
00:15:21,020 --> 00:15:23,380
卡洛琳 如果我想跟一群天天好心情的人共事
Caroline, if I wanted to work around people in a good mood,

365
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,740
我早去谷歌上班了
I'd go work at Google.

366
00:15:26,620 --> 00:15:28,400
她从昨天开始就睡不着
She hasn't slept since yesterday

367
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:30,780
因为我不愿意给她安眠药 她现在超级火大
and is furious because I won't give her a sleeping pill.

368
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:32,320
明智之举
Smart move.

369
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:34,360
安眠药只会把人搞得更糟
Sleeping pills mess you up.

370
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,860
我曾经吃过一次 结果在一天后醒来
I took one once, woke up a day later

371
00:15:36,860 --> 00:15:38,940
发现自己科尼岛的云霄飞车上
on the roller coaster ride in Coney Island.

372
00:15:40,260 --> 00:15:41,840
我喜欢云霄飞车
I love roller coasters.

373
00:15:42,220 --> 00:15:43,640
但得是坐在座位里我才喜欢啊
Me too, when I'm in a seat.

374
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:47,360
你们好啊
Oh, hello!

375
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:49,020
你们俩今晚好吗
How are you two tonight?

376
00:15:49,380 --> 00:15:50,380
天啊 她太友善了
Oh, no. She's nice.

377
00:15:50,420 --> 00:15:51,740
她肯定从哪里搞到安眠药了
She must've gotten a pill somewhere.

378
00:15:52,140 --> 00:15:54,720
不 我没吃药 只是想明白了
No. No pills. Just had some clarity.

379
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:56,520
-请跟我来 -好吧
- Follow me, please. - Oh, okay.

380
00:15:56,520 --> 00:15:58,440
你是"抽"明白了 还是"吸"明白了
Did you smoke or snort this clarity?

381
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:03,240
既然你这么好 送我新床单
Yeah, since you were nice enough to get me new sheets,

382
00:16:03,260 --> 00:16:05,360
我也有东西作为回礼 给
I got you something in return. Here.

383
00:16:05,980 --> 00:16:07,560
这是表示歉意的同时
Oh, is this like an apology,

384
00:16:07,560 --> 00:16:08,860
兼表示谢意吗
thank you kind of thing?

385
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:09,960
给我看好了
Now watch.

386
00:16:10,060 --> 00:16:12,680
人接受礼物时就应该这么优雅
This is how one graciously accepts a gift.

387
00:16:13,500 --> 00:16:15,100
这是啥玩意啊
What the hell is this?

388
00:16:18,100 --> 00:16:19,040
假发
A wig?

389
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:22,400
不然就是你剥了80年代拉拉的头皮
Either that or you scalped a lesbian from the '80s.

390
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,860
是的 我一把抓住她的波洛领带
Yep, I grabbed her bolo tie

391
00:16:25,860 --> 00:16:27,340
然后爬上她的垫肩[当年流行]
and climbed up on her shoulder pads.

392
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:30,120
你夺走让我有安全感的东西
You took away my security thing--

393
00:16:30,300 --> 00:16:31,180
我的枕套
the pillowcase--

394
00:16:31,200 --> 00:16:33,100
所以现在我要夺走让你有安全感的东西
So now I'm taking away your security thing--

395
00:16:33,220 --> 00:16:33,920
你的头发
your hair.

396
00:16:34,060 --> 00:16:35,560
你今晚可以戴着那玩意
You can wear that on your head tonight

397
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:37,360
然后告诉我一切都只是心理作用可以克服
and then tell me again how this is all in my head.

398
00:16:37,660 --> 00:16:39,540
你非得买人家店里最丑的那一顶吗
Did you have to get the ugliest one they had?

399
00:16:39,980 --> 00:16:41,580
3毛7的东西 你还想要求什么
What do you want for 37 cents?

400
00:16:43,420 --> 00:16:46,340
好吧 我会把这个烂玩意顶头上
Fine! I'll put this roadkill on my head

401
00:16:46,340 --> 00:16:49,020
向你证明 我的价值不只是这头秀发
Just to prove to you that I am so much more than my hair.

402
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:53,080
还有我的态度 心灵 大脑和勇气
I am my attitude, my spirit, my brain, my bravery.

403
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:54,180
-戴上它 -麦克斯 我好害怕
- Put it on. - Max, I'm scared.

404
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:57,120
快 把刘海拨到后面[从后面搞]
Go. The bangs go in the back.

405
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:59,480
我就喜欢这种女人
That's my kinda woman.

406
00:17:00,768 --> 00:17:02,519
科布沙拉 上菜
Cobb salad, pick-up!

407
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:09,740
苏菲
Uh...hey, Sophie.

408
00:17:10,360 --> 00:17:12,500
你是知道有黑手党寡妇折扣 才穿着这样吗
Are you here for the mafia widow discount?

409
00:17:14,094 --> 00:17:17,920
厄尔 我在保持低调
Earl, I'm incognito.

410
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:19,920
偷偷来给麦克斯送药的
I'm making a drug drop for Max.

411
00:17:21,260 --> 00:17:23,080
麦克斯 你的药[毒品]来了
Hey, Max! I got your drugs!

412
00:17:25,580 --> 00:17:26,300
谢啦
Thanks.

413
00:17:26,300 --> 00:17:27,960
我爱死你永远能找到一套
And I love that you have an outfit

414
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:29,440
适合我让你干的事的衣服
for everything I ask you to do.

415
00:17:30,391 --> 00:17:32,687
那个金发缉毒特警呢 麦克斯
Where's the blonde narc, Max?

416
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:42,040
天啊
Oh, my God!

417
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:44,600
卡洛琳加入保龄球队了吗
Did Caroline join a bowling team?

418
00:17:47,420 --> 00:17:48,470
麦克斯 不行
Max! No!

419
00:17:49,004 --> 00:17:50,480
糟糕
Aw, crap!

420
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:52,200
被罗德·斯图尔特逮个正着
Rod Stewart just busted us.

421
00:17:53,520 --> 00:17:56,400
让她爽一下吧 有啥大不了的 老古板
Let her have some fun. What's the big deal, square?

422
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:59,820
因为她觉得自己需要这药的理由
The big deal is that Max thinks she needs these pills

423
00:17:59,820 --> 00:18:01,680
是因为我丢了她的小被被
because I threw away her blankie.

424
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:04,300
那是个枕套 有它我才能睡着
It was a pillowcase, and I need it to sleep.

425
00:18:04,460 --> 00:18:05,500
她得摸着才能睡
She has to rub it.

426
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:07,240
在波兰
In Poland,

427
00:18:07,280 --> 00:18:10,120
我也有样小东西
I had this little thing that I liked to tickle

428
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:11,640
喜欢在睡觉前玩
before I went to sleep.

429
00:18:12,260 --> 00:18:14,460
但也被我姨母扔了
But my aunt threw it away.

430
00:18:15,080 --> 00:18:16,000
那是什么
What was it?

431
00:18:16,580 --> 00:18:18,300
我的诺拉表妹
It was my cousin Nora.

432
00:18:21,860 --> 00:18:23,800
-把药给我 -不要
- Give me the pills. - Nope.

433
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:25,260
麦克斯 你是错的 瞧我
And, Max, you were wrong. See?

434
00:18:25,260 --> 00:18:26,400
我一点都不依赖我的头发
I'm not attached to my hair.

435
00:18:26,460 --> 00:18:28,560
老实说 我开始爱上我的新发型
In fact, I am loving my new look.

436
00:18:28,860 --> 00:18:31,240
我是个懒得打扮的单亲母亲
Am I a single mom trying to keep it simple?

437
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:33,880
或是助理地方检察官呢
Am I an assistant D.A. in over my head?

438
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:37,980
又或是邦·乔飞故事里的查理兹·塞隆
Or am I Charlize Theron in the Jon Bon Jovi story?

439
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:42,960
或许吧 我完全不介意
Maybe, and I'm fine with it.

440
00:18:43,040 --> 00:18:44,240
因为我一点也不看重我的头发
'cause I am not my hair.

441
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:47,440
天啊 火鸡三明治帅哥 掩护我
Oh, my god, turkey club cutie! Hide me!

442
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:53,680
戴着难看的假发 双膝跪地
On your knees in a bad wig.

443
00:18:54,060 --> 00:18:55,200
姑娘 我也有过这样的经历
Listen, girl, I've been there.

444
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:58,200
不 我只是不想被人看见
No, I just don't wanna be seen.

445
00:18:58,260 --> 00:18:59,400
卡洛琳 卡洛琳 我爱你
Caroline, Caroline, I love you,

446
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:00,400
但我听不下去了
But I can't hear anymore.

447
00:19:00,500 --> 00:19:02,860
这顶假发即使在70年代 也让人不忍直视
That hair was hard enough to look at in the '70s.

448
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:08,960
好吧 你是对的 我是错的
Fine! You were right, I was wrong.

449
00:19:09,040 --> 00:19:11,300
帮我把假发脱下来 我不能让他见我这样
Now help me get this off. He can't see me like this.

450
00:19:11,380 --> 00:19:12,580
没错 把药给我
That's right, gimme the pills.

451
00:19:13,140 --> 00:19:14,460
麦克斯 不 你不需要
Max, no. You don't need them.

452
00:19:14,460 --> 00:19:15,540
我们都不知道这药哪来的
We don't know where they've been.

453
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:16,740
好吧
Fine!

454
00:19:16,740 --> 00:19:18,740
那我回家睡觉
I'm going home to try to sleep.

455
00:19:19,040 --> 00:19:21,100
既然这都是你的错 那你来替我上班吧
Since this is all your fault, you can finish my shift.

456
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:22,140
你自己上班吧
You're on your own,

457
00:19:22,180 --> 00:19:23,900
80年代肥皂剧那个住在对面街的女人
lady who lived across the street from Al Bundy

458
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:32,900
不得不说 我真佩服我自己也能接发
I gotta say, I'm pretty impressed I can do this.

459
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:34,100
其实没那么难嘛
It's not so hard.

460
00:19:34,140 --> 00:19:36,120
我不懂钱妮丝干嘛老抱怨
I don't know what Chanice is always bitching about.

461
00:19:36,900 --> 00:19:38,080
或许她就是个爱抱怨的贱人吧
I guess that's who she is.

462
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:41,420
真不敢相信我到现在还没睡着
I can't believe I still haven't slept.

463
00:19:41,660 --> 00:19:42,880
我这辈子都别想睡觉了
I'm gonna be awake forever.

464
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:46,020
最后会像那部电影《唤醒》 但我是想睡死过去
It's gonna be like that movie Awakenings, but not at all.

465
00:19:47,540 --> 00:19:49,720
麦克斯 你可以摸我
Max, you can rub me.

466
00:19:51,980 --> 00:19:53,880
哇 那顶拉拉假发把你掰弯啦
Wow, that wig changed you.

467
00:19:55,320 --> 00:19:56,220
不 是这里
No, here.

468
00:19:56,220 --> 00:19:58,100
摸我睡衣下面的花边
Rub the edge on the bottom of my jammie top

469
00:19:58,100 --> 00:19:59,900
-把它当成是你的枕套 -不要
- like it's your pillowcase. - No.

470
00:20:00,020 --> 00:20:01,600
如果我摸你睡衣的下面
If I rub the bottom of your jammies,

471
00:20:01,620 --> 00:20:02,620
那我就会变成无下限
that would be my bottom.

472
00:20:04,260 --> 00:20:06,060
火鸡三明治帅哥没有约我出去
Turkey club cutie didn't ask me out,

473
00:20:06,060 --> 00:20:08,180
可能是因为我的头发被假发弄得太乱了
probably because my hair was so messed up from the wig.

474
00:20:08,660 --> 00:20:09,920
别对自己那么苛刻
Don't be so hard on yourself.

475
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:11,500
也有可能是讨厌你性格啊
it could've been your personality too.

476
00:20:13,540 --> 00:20:15,680
你真的觉得他是因为头发才喜欢你吗
You really think he only liked you for your hair?

477
00:20:15,680 --> 00:20:17,733
反正我是
I only like me for my hair.

478
00:20:17,733 --> 00:20:19,780
早说了吧 你就是爱它
Told you. You're attached to it.

479
00:20:19,780 --> 00:20:20,980
我超级爱我的头发
So attached to it!

480
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:23,400
用手转着玩 甩着玩 翻着玩
Twirling it, tossing it, flipping it.

481
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:26,580
在我的脖子 肩膀还有后背感觉它
Feeling it on my neck, on my shoulders, on my back.

482
00:20:27,020 --> 00:20:28,140
没有光滑发髻的卡洛琳·钱宁
Caroline Channing without the option

483
00:20:28,140 --> 00:20:30,380
就不是卡洛琳·钱宁了
of a sleek updo is not Caroline Channing.

484
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:32,520
对不起啦
And I'm sorry.

485
00:20:33,300 --> 00:20:34,300
很抱歉我因为
I'm sorry I judged you

486
00:20:34,300 --> 00:20:35,700
你对某物过于依赖而批评你
for having an attachment to something

487
00:20:35,700 --> 00:20:36,700
而我也没好到哪去
when I'm no better.

488
00:20:37,520 --> 00:20:39,940
抱歉我把你亲爱的寝具扔了
And I'm sorry I got rid of your sweet sheets.

489
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:41,380
麦克斯
Max.

490
00:20:42,560 --> 00:20:43,040
麦克斯
Max?

491
00:20:44,460 --> 00:20:46,520
晚安 麦克斯
Night, Max.

492
00:20:54,047 --> 00:20:57,040
为什么啊
Whyyyy?

493
00:20:57,040 --> 00:20:59,960
为什么我就不能拥有点好东西呢
Why can't I ever have anything nice?
